usage: p4_operator.py [-h] --isolated-profile ISOLATED_PROFILE
                      --isolated-port ISOLATED_PORT
                      --installed-app INSTALLED_APP
                      --installed-interpreter INSTALLED_INTERPRETER
                      --package-manifest PACKAGE_MANIFEST
                      --receipt-root RECEIPT_ROOT
                      [--forbid-checkout FORBID_CHECKOUT]
                      [--package-path PACKAGE_PATH]
                      [--source-bindings SOURCE_BINDINGS]
                      [--runtime-mode {installed,source-runtime,instrument-only}]
                      [--instrument-only] [--operator-json OPERATOR_JSON]
                      [--client-exe CLIENT_EXE] [--prompt-file PROMPT_FILE]
                      [--client-route {ordinary,recall}]
                      [--subscription-confirmed] [--usage-credits-off]
                      [--timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS]
                      {prepare,check,prepare-client,collect,client}

Ryan's guarded P4 command driver; system Python -I -S, never a model by
default.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,check,prepare-client,collect,client}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --isolated-profile ISOLATED_PROFILE
  --isolated-port ISOLATED_PORT
  --installed-app INSTALLED_APP
  --installed-interpreter INSTALLED_INTERPRETER
  --package-manifest PACKAGE_MANIFEST
  --receipt-root RECEIPT_ROOT
  --forbid-checkout FORBID_CHECKOUT
  --package-path PACKAGE_PATH
                        Actual package bytes; required for installed
                        eligibility
  --source-bindings SOURCE_BINDINGS
                        Candidate-package same-purpose sealed file digests
                        (SHA-256 per file, 40-hex git blobs)
  --runtime-mode {installed,source-runtime,instrument-only}
                        installed requires sealed provenance; source-runtime
                        is the pre-Inno path
  --instrument-only     Synthetic instrument check; not installed credit
  --operator-json OPERATOR_JSON
  --client-exe CLIENT_EXE
  --prompt-file PROMPT_FILE
  --client-route {ordinary,recall}
  --subscription-confirmed
  --usage-credits-off
  --timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS
